time to reflect on your
mistake there's nothing

275
00:16:29,820 --> 00:16:32,237
like Prison to change a
man's attitude and just

276
00:16:32,320 --> 00:16:34,137
in case that doesn't work
I'm going to have that

277
00:16:34,220 --> 00:16:39,777
Rebellious streak beaten
out of you you're an

278
00:16:39,860 --> 00:16:42,137
excellent god in the
citizens trust don't be a

279
