To hell with status.

289
00:17:16,700 --> 00:17:18,380
To hell with the king.

290
00:17:20,720 --> 00:17:23,380
You dare mock me too, stupid bird!

291
00:17:23,620 --> 00:17:24,855
I'm the king of drum!

292
00:17:29,060 --> 00:17:30,240
Yeah, so what?

293
00:17:30,860 --> 00:17:34,680
It doesn't matter if you're a
