308
00:18:12,160 --> 00:18:13,040
Tang Cannon!

309
00:18:14,160 --> 00:18:16,920
His tongue turned into a cannon! Goodbye!

310
00:18:34,680 --> 00:18:36,900
Dalton, someone help me lift him.

311
00:18:37,080 --> 00:18:39,180
Dalton, can you hear me? Dalton!

312
00:18:39,600 --> 00:18:40,960
Say something, please.

313
00:18:41,220 --> 00:18:43,020
You can't die, you just can't.

314
00:18:43,440 --> 00:18:44,760
Dalton, please.

315
00:18:46,780 --> 00:18:47,660
I'm okay.

316
00:18:51,320 --> 00:18:52,560
Please don't die.

317
00:18:58,560 --> 00:18:59,520
I won't.

318
00:18:59,860 --> 00:19:00,800
I can't.

319
00:19:01,140 --> 00:19:05,137
Not until I put an end to Wobble
and what he's done to this country.

320
00:19:05,220 --> 00:19:08,680
A government should care about
its country and its people.

321
00:19:08,980 --> 00:19:10,197
You mean you weren't joking?

322
00:19:10,280 --> 00:19:12,456
That's what you really think, Dalton?

323
00:19:13,280 --> 00:19:14,110
Please.

324
00:19:14,200 --> 00:19:16,297
A government doesn't need to have a heart.

325
00:19:16,380 --> 00:19:17,210
That's right.

326
00:19:17,293 --> 00:19:19,338
It just needs to control the people.

327
00:19:27,180 --> 00:19:28,037
What are you doing?

328
00:19:28,120 --> 00:19:28,950
Unhand me!

329
00:19:30,100 --> 00:19:31,780
Stop it! Let me go!

330
00:19:31,980 --> 00:19:33,037
You can't do this!

331
00:19:33,120 --> 00:19:35,277
I have patients who will
die if I don't treat them!

332
00:19:35,360 --> 00:19:36,677
Throw him in the ocean!

333
00:19:36,760 --> 00:19:39,437
If he resists, you have my
permission to shoot him!

334
00:19:39,520 --> 00:19:40,350
No!

335
00:19:40,433 --> 00:19:42,005
Think of my patients at least!

336
00:19:42,700 --> 00:19:44,097
They're the ones who are going to suffer!

337
00:19:44,180 --> 00:19:45,010
Don't do this!

338
00:19:48,100 --> 00:19:50,276
To hell with controlling the country.

339
00:19:55,460 --> 00:19:57,420
God, and none of them are sick.

340
00:20:00,620 --> 00:20:04,561
I'll show them what happens to a
country that doesn't have a heart.

341
