342
00:20:17,360 --> 00:20:18,440
Everyone listen.

343
00:20:18,640 --> 00:20:23,111
Once we arrive, take cover, because
once I'm inside, there'll be explosions.

344
00:20:27,740 --> 00:20:28,800
That idiot!

345
00:20:28,980 --> 00:20:30,274
He let his guard down!

346
00:20:33,360 --> 00:20:35,520
Pollock is talking! Huh?

347
00:20:35,680 --> 00:20:37,537
One, two...

348
00:20:37,620 --> 00:20:40,520
Hey, what are you doing? Shit!

349
00:20:41,400 --> 00:20:42,230
No, stop!

350
00:20:42,660 --> 00:20:43,760
Gum-Gum!

351
00:21:03,120 --> 00:21:04,000
Dr.

352
00:21:04,180 --> 00:21:08,840
E, it certainly seems
like it's finally over.

353
00:21:15,000 --> 00:21:17,235
I told you not to mess with that flag!

354
00:21:17,320 --> 00:21:19,496
Now I'm finally gonna kick your butt!

355
00:21:24,180 --> 00:21:25,010
Doctor...

356
00:21:25,800 --> 00:21:26,660
Wait a minute!

357
00:21:26,920 --> 00:21:29,214
I'll give you a battle of the position!

358
00:21:29,560 --> 00:21:30,390
Look!

359
00:21:30,480 --> 00:21:33,304
There's something going
on on top of the castle!

360
00:21:39,380 --> 00:21:40,210
Doctor...

361
00:21:45,160 --> 00:21:46,637
This...is kingdom.

362
00:21:46,720 --> 00:21:50,120
Drum kingdom, it's...

363
00:21:53,400 --> 00:21:54,480
Fine!

364
00:21:54,940 --> 00:21:56,352
I'll make you Vice King!

365
00:21:56,720 --> 00:21:58,640
It's about to fall!

366
00:21:59,440 --> 00:22:00,520
Bazooka!

367
00:22:28,620 --> 00:22:33,200
So the Drum Kingdom was ultimately
defeated by the skull and crossbones.

368
00:22:49,860 --> 00:22:51,040
Everybody wait here.

369
00:22:51,240 --> 00:22:55,358
I'll brave whatever dangers lie ahead
and let you know when it's safe.

370
00:22:57,560 --> 00:22:58,680
I'm going first.

371
00:23:09,920 --> 00:23:11,837
Hey, what the hell are you doing?

372
00:23:11,920 --> 00:23:14,837
Just watching your back
hiding behind someone like it.

373
00:23:14,920 --> 00:23:17,273
Why'd you even come if you're so scared?

374
00:23:17,460 --> 00:23:19,048
Scared don't be ridiculous.

375
00:23:19,220 --> 00:23:21,338
I always laugh at the face of danger

376
00:23:39,860 --> 00:23:41,566
Why'd you do that, you moron?

377
00:23:41,700 --> 00:23:43,740
I didn't recognize you at first.

378
00:23:44,960 --> 00:23:47,897
I thought you were more of Big
Mouse guards coming to fight.

379
00:23:47,980 --> 00:23:50,657
Well, I'm really surprised you
guys came all the way up here.

380
00:23:50,740 --> 00:23:51,940
Well, not you, Zoro.

381
00:23:52,120 --> 00:23:56,944
But you, Usopp, aren't you normally scared
of doing stuff like climbing mountains?

382
00:23:57,700 --> 00:23:58,640
Yeah, right.

383
00:23:59,260 --> 00:24:02,357
Whenever there's a towering peak
in front of me, I get to climbing.

384
00:24:02,440 --> 00:24:06,417
But let me tell you, scaling that
mountain hand over hand was no picnic.

385
00:24:06,500 --> 00:24:09,265
Actually, we took a
ropeway car up here, Luffy.

386
00:24:09,860 --> 00:24:11,877
Tommy and Sanji, are they all right?

387
00:24:11,960 --> 00:24:14,220
Yeah, both of them are just fine.

388
00:24:15,220 --> 00:24:16,102
Thank goodness.

389
00:24:16,740 --> 00:24:19,440
But let me tell you,
taking it was no picnic.

390
00:24:20,020 --> 00:24:20,850
Here's why.

391
00:24:20,933 --> 00:24:21,763
Good.

392
00:24:21,846 --> 00:24:25,757
We were on the way, then a giant condor
flew out of nowhere and attacked us.

393
00:24:25,840 --> 00:24:29,677
So, what was that you were doing on
top of the castle a few minutes ago?

394
00:24:29,760 --> 00:24:32,000
Beating the crap out of the king. Oh.

395
00:24:33,060 --> 00:24:33,890
Okay.

396
00:24:34,060 --> 00:24:37,697
You mean that person I saw flying
through the air was actually Wapol?

397
00:24:37,780 --> 00:24:39,720
You beat him? Yep.

398
00:24:39,860 --> 00:24:40,690
I sure did!

399
00:24:40,773 --> 00:24:43,357
I threw a rope around his neck
and show that bird who was boss!

400
00:24:43,440 --> 00:24:44,270
ME!

401
00:24:44,353 --> 00:24:45,183
Captain Usopp!

402
00:24:45,266 --> 00:24:46,197
And his two henchmen,
what happened to them?

403
00:24:46,280 --> 00:24:50,480
Oh, well, the reindeer beat them
up. What? Those two? A reindeer?

404
00:24:50,960 --> 00:24:52,489
Once again, Captain Usopp!

405
00:24:52,620 --> 00:24:53,450
Oh, hey, Usopp!

406
00:24:53,533 --> 00:24:54,517
I made a new friend!

407
00:24:54,600 --> 00:24:55,577
And you gotta meet him!

408
00:24:55,660 --> 00:24:56,490
Get this!

409
00:24:56,573 --> 00:24:57,403
He's a reindeer!

410
00:24:58,580 --> 00:24:59,410
Reindeer?

411
00:25:01,100 --> 00:25:01,980
A reindeer...

412
